\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Frequencies of several maternal characteristics and pregnancy exposures among cases and controls were considered\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"the only indicator of whether a mother might have taken high-dosage folic acid supplement was reported use of a single-ingredient folic acid supplement\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"this sample of mothers with a previous NTD-affected pregnancy should be considered a convenience sample\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\", \"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}